  "equipment_ceiling_source": "CT-RGO-15: a basic club gym: barbells, racks, benches, dumbbells and a dip attachment, with no machines, cables or pull-up bar. The library has no trap-bar, landmine or band exercises. The lifter's own equipment list narrows it further (G-15).",
